==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|со-}}
* {{ru-IPA|со́-}} {{i|when stressed}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*sъ(n)-}} (see {{m|ru|с-}} and {{cog|sla-pro|*sъ(n)}} for more information). The {{glossary|yer}} sound {{lang|sla-pro|-ъ-}} was treated as strong when another yer followed in the next syllable, and was vocalized to {{lang|sla-pro|-o-}}, whereas the yer in the next syllable was deleted, producing a consonant cluster.

====Prefix====
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{alternative form of|ru|с-}} {{i|used before certain consonant clusters}}

===Etymology 2===
Borrowed from {{bor|ru|cu|съ-}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъ(n)-}}; see above.

